      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Constant corresponding to mediaProjection in the foregroundServiceType attribute. To capture through MediaProjection, an app must start a foreground service with the type corresponding to this constant. This type should only be used for MediaProjection. Capturing screen contents via createVirtualDisplay conveniently allows recording, presenting screen contents into a meeting, taking screenshots, or several other scenarios.</para>
          <para>Starting foreground service with this type from apps targeting API level Build.VERSION_CODES.UPSIDE_DOWN_CAKE and later, will require permission Manifest.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PROJECTION, and the user must have allowed the screen capture request from this app.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/content/pm/ServiceInfo#FOREGROUND_SERVICE_TYPE_MEDIA_PROJECTION" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.content.pm.ServiceInfo.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_TYPE_MEDIA_PROJECTION</code>.</a></format></para>
